# Settings for the teamdesk card.
# Edit this copy on the machine before you start the containers.
# The organization id is not a line here. It comes from the logged-in CLI.

# Serving device for place teamdesk.
# The name is the one `edgible device list` prints. The Compose file does not read this.
DEVICE=

# Host port for teamdesk. The container port stays 3000.
TEAMDESK_PORT=3000

# Label used to build the teamdesk hostname.
# It is the part after the app name in a hostname `edgible app list` prints.
ORG_LABEL=

# The domain Edgible gives new apps' hostnames: edgible.app since October 2026.
# An app published earlier keeps its edgible.com hostname: set edgible.com for it.
EDGIBLE_DOMAIN=edgible.app

# The first admin of the team. Teamdesk has no sign-in of its own: Edgible's
# sign-in decides who reaches the app, and the people on this page choose who
# they act as. Only an admin can add members, so a new database needs one.
# Used only while the team is empty; later changes here do nothing.
TEAMDESK_ADMIN_EMAIL=
TEAMDESK_ADMIN_NAME=Admin

# Your own build of the app, from card.yml source:. Leave it commented out to run the
# pinned image. See Customising in the README.
# TEAMDESK_IMAGE=teamdesk:custom
